> Connect a model API

  Pick the provider. Its URL is filled in; you bring the API key.
  No UnieAI account is needed.

   1. OpenAI                               api.openai.com
>  2. OpenRouter                           openrouter.ai
   3. DeepSeek                             api.deepseek.com
   4. Groq                                 api.groq.com
   5. Together                             api.together.xyz
   6. Mistral                              api.mistral.ai
   7. Google Gemini (OpenAI-compatible)    generativelanguage.googleapis.com
   8. Ollama (local)                       localhost:11434
   9. LM Studio (local)                    localhost:1234
  10. Custom URL (vLLM, SGLang, llama.cpp, your own server…)

  Press enter to continue
  Press esc to go back
